&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1244&quot; data-local-id=&quot;284825de2caa&quot;&gt;Driving continuous improvement and automation of repetitive deployment and acceptance-testing work&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1346&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c049d4879183&quot;&gt;Running structured, high-signal status communications so stakeholders always know where a deployment stands&lt;/p&gt;
